#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:4
msgid "LetterGator | Privacy"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:11
msgid "How LetterGator protects your data"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:14
msgid ""
"Your letters are encrypted before storage and decrypted only inside "
"authorized application flows. We use strict access controls so each user can "
"only interact with their own letters."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:23
msgid "1. Encrypted storage"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:25
msgid ""
"Letter content is encrypted at rest. Database access alone does not reveal "
"readable message text."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:33
msgid "2. Ownership checks"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:35
msgid ""
"Letters are linked to your user account by user ID. Access to list, edit, "
"and delete operations is validated against ownership."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:43
msgid "3. Controlled preview"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:45
msgid ""
"Message previews are available only when your letter settings allow sender "
"preview, or after delivery according to application rules."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:53
msgid "4. Operational security"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:55
msgid ""
"Encryption keys are managed through server configuration and are not stored "
"in the database alongside encrypted messages."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:4
msgid "LetterGator | Terms of Service"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:9
msgid "Legal"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:11
msgid "Terms of Service"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:13
msgid "Last updated: May 2026"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:15
msgid ""
"By creating an account or using LetterGator, you agree to the following "
"terms. Please read them carefully before using the service."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:24
msgid "1. Service description"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:26
msgid ""
"LetterGator is a time-delayed letter delivery service. You compose a "
"message, choose a future delivery date, and the platform delivers it to the "
"specified recipients when that date arrives. The service is intended for "
"personal, family, and professional use only."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:36
msgid "2. Account eligibility"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:38
msgid ""
"You must be at least 18 years old to create an account. You are responsible "
"for keeping your login credentials confidential and for all activity that "
"occurs under your account."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:47
msgid "3. Acceptable use"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:49
msgid ""
"You agree not to use LetterGator to send spam, harassing content, illegal "
"material, or any content that violates the rights of others. Letters sent "
"through the platform must have a legitimate, consented recipient. We reserve "
"the right to terminate accounts that violate these rules."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:60
msgid "4. Pricing and billing"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:62
msgid ""
"Letters scheduled for delivery within 1 year of creation are free. Letters "
"scheduled 1 year or more in the future incur a fee of $0.50 per year of the "
"schedule. This charge is deducted once from your balance when you confirm "
"the letter. There are no recurring subscription fees; you only pay for what "
"you schedule."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:73
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Delivery Date"
msgid "5. Delivery commitment"
msgstr "Дата доставки"

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:75
msgid ""
"We make reasonable efforts to deliver letters on the scheduled date using "
"automated systems with retry logic. However, we cannot guarantee delivery in "
"cases where a recipient's email address is no longer valid, their inbox "
"rejects messages, or extraordinary technical circumstances arise. We will "
"flag delivery issues in your account."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:87
msgid "6. Message content and encryption"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:89
msgid ""
"Your message content is encrypted before storage. LetterGator staff cannot "
"read the contents of your letters. You remain solely responsible for the "
"content you write. Additionally, encrypted letter data is backed up to "
"Arweave, a permanent decentralised blockchain storage network, to ensure "
"long-term availability of your letters even in unexpected situations."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:101
msgid "7. Edit and deletion rights"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:103
msgid ""
"If you enable the Allow Edit or Allow Delete options when creating a letter, "
"those actions are available only during the first 30 days after creation. "
"Once the window expires, or if the options were not enabled, the letter is "
"permanently locked until delivery."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:113
msgid "8. Account and email validity"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:115
msgid ""
"To keep your letters deliverable over long timeframes, we send an annual re-"
"confirmation email to verify your address is still active. You can update "
"your email address in your profile at any time; the new address must be "
"confirmed before it becomes active for delivery. You may also provide a "
"phone number and address in your profile as supplementary contact "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:127
msgid "9. Termination"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:129
msgid ""
"You may close your account at any time by contacting us. Upon account "
"closure, undelivered letters will no longer be dispatched. We reserve the "
"right to suspend or terminate accounts that breach these terms without prior "
"notice."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:139
msgid "10. Limitation of liability"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:141
msgid ""
"LetterGator is provided \"as is\". To the maximum extent permitted by "
"applicable law, we are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential "
"damages arising from your use of the service, including missed deliveries or "
"loss of content beyond our reasonable control."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:152
msgid "11. Changes to these terms"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/terms.html:154
msgid ""
"We may update these terms from time to time. If material changes are made, "
"we will notify you by email. Continued use of the service after such notice "
"constitutes acceptance of the updated terms."
msgstr ""

